streetCryptid Linux repeater

The CLI and daemon are part of the streetCryptid repository, licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later
(LICENSE). They are built on the desktop repeater host it shares with the Windows repeater, the
repeater server crate (trail-stash) and the roster/wire crate it shares with the phone, all in the
same repository:

https://github.com/unrealJune/streetCryptid/tree/main/repeater

The binary is built against noq 1.4.0 with one fix (MIT OR Apache-2.0), from third_party/noq in
that repository; its NOTICE lists the modification. Each release carries the source archive it was
built from.
